    {
      "id": 171,
      "title": "Project Scanner Module – Remote scan of Main PC from Dell 630 (Dell 630 scans Main PC over LAN)",
      "description": "Create a configurable \"project scanner\" that runs on the Dell 630 (Helix agent + OKF server in separate Proxmox VMs) and remotely scans the Main PC (where coding/development happens) over the local network. Must support a programmable list of projects + per-PC and per-project settings in config. Outputs structured trees suitable for Mermaid (primary) / OKF bundles. Note: User clarified possible confusion between Markmap and Mermaid — primary focus is Mermaid diagrams (already supported in schema from task 167).",
      "status": "done",
      "results": "Done per bot review 2026-11-05 (PreRelese 17fddd7): src/tools/project_scanner.rs (713 lines), ProjectScanResult with scanned_from/target_machine, [helix.project_scanner] + [[helix.projects]] parsing in src/config/project_scanner.rs, scan_projects tool wired in src/tools/mod.rs:76,437, SSH remote stub behind optional ssh feature; tests at project_scanner.rs:502-618 + tools/mod.rs:808-832. Caveat: no separately recorded live run from the R630; unit tests cover the local-scan path.",
