      "id": 221,
      "title": "Gemini backend tool-calling loop (Ranger 1)",
      "description": "Sapper 1 found src/io/llm_gemini/mod.rs has NO function calling at all — no functionDeclarations, no tool loop, no tool_call publish. The commander pattern cannot delegate on Gemini until this exists, and John wants Gemini as his fast commander pick.",
      "status": "done",
