      "description": "Add an auth-gated 'Update' button to the web UI that runs `cd ~/helix && git pull && cargo build --release && cargo run --bin installer` on the R630 as a detached background job (must survive helix stopping itself mid-update), streams progress to the UI, and lets the page auto-reconnect when the service comes back.",
      "status": "done",
