      "results": "DONE 2026-10-11 ~02:55 UTC by Code Ranger 1. New module src/persona.rs (987 lines, 18 unit tests green): persona dir/file resolution (runtime dir = parent of config.toml, role sanitization rejects traversal), YAML frontmatter tool allowlists stripped before injection, persona-then-job composition, .pending approval flow (apply/discard, 4KB cap, .bak.1-3 rotation, 1/hour rate limiter, runaway tripwire), stub-aware drafting (HELIX_PERSONA_TEST_STUB). Injection sites unified: commander_system_message() now delegates to persona::composed_commander_text(); both Gemini direct const refs replaced; SUBAGENT_JOB_PROMPT extracted byte-identical. Sub-agents get real system messages on Ollama and system_instruction on Gemini; toolsets filtered per role (spawn_subagent never re-added). Lesson trigger on Failed/TimedOut spawns (best-effort, .pending only). [helix.persona] self_author parsed in main.rs (default false); initial draft spawned at boot. /persona slash commands (status/approve/discard/draft) + help text. Tests: 18 new persona tests green; tools::subagent_tool 14/14; io::llm_gemini 6/6; io::web_server 31/31; full lib 332 passed, 6 failed = pre-existing task-213 failures (a2a x2, acp::agent x2, mcp_client x2), verified unrelated. Deviations: none material. Follow-ups for John: default-deny allowlist (his call, recommended not yet); web UI editor for agent.md (Sapper 1, task-213 modal pattern); chat announcement of pending drafts."
