      "description": "Helix-side wiring for the support@ mailbox watcher: config template + docs for a mail-mcp MCP server entry (mirroring the google-mcp pattern), and verified graceful behavior when the binary is not installed. The mail-mcp INSTALL itself is John's ops step, not this task.",
      "status": "done",
