      "id": 257,
      "title": "Draft-for-review reply flow (hard no-auto-send invariant)",
      "description": "Replies are staged as pending drafts and NEVER send without John's explicit tap. Mirrors the task-233 persona .pending/approve pattern. This is the safety-critical piece of SYSADMIN-01.",
      "status": "done",
      "dependencies": [
        255
