      "description": "Add the [self_improve] config section following the [voice] load_section precedent, with fail-closed defaults and every spec budget knob. This is the loop's master switchboard; all later phases read it.",
      "details": "HARD RULES (loop spec, non-negotiable — violation fails the task): the loop never merges, never pushes to master, never restarts the service, never writes the live tree or live config, never sends outbound mail/chat. The loop never grades its own homework alone — the external Quartermaster remains the independent check.\n\nNew module layout: src/self_improve/mod.rs + config.rs (+ metrics.rs, budgets.rs, git.rs, evaluator.rs, audit.rs, pr.rs in later tasks); register `pub mod self_improve;` in src/lib.rs after the support_watch/voice lines (lib.rs:28-29 at c7ecc41).\n\nNew file src/self_improve/config.rs: struct SelfImproveConfig loaded via crate::config::load_section (src/config/mod.rs:25), mirroring VoiceConfig::load_from_toml (src/voice/config.rs:93). Fields with fail-closed defaults: enabled=false (kill-switch #1 master switch), phase=0 (0=collect-only, 1=propose, 2=evaluate, 3=pr-if-allowed — ONLY John edits this in config; the loop never writes config), cadence schedule string (routine schedule, default \"daily 03:30\" — see task 281), max_proposals_per_week=3, max_open_per_signature=1, max_cycle_minutes=60, max_diff_lines=500, declined_cooldown_days=30, failed_eval_cooldown_days=7, max_worktrees=1, triage_backend=\"local\", draft_backend=\"gemini\" (D3 default: local-triage + Gemini-draft), pr_opening=false (D1 RUNTIME default OFF — queue-only), eval_set_approved=false (D5 gate, default CLOSED — task 242's set is DRAFT), stop_file=\"SELF_IMPROVE_OFF\" (runtime dir), worktree_dir=\"self_improve/worktrees\" (runtime dir), ledger_path=\"self_improve/ledger.jsonl\" (runtime dir). Missing section or malformed values fall back to these defaults with a logged warning (task 265 pattern: log keys, never values).\n\nDocument every key in example.config.toml as commented defaults, mirroring the [voice] docs (example.config.toml:137+). Update CHANGELOG.md.\n\nRANGER 1 RESULT: RANGER 1: config.rs + mod.rs scaffolding, example.config.toml docs, CHANGELOG. 10 new lib tests green (5 config + 5 kill-switch). Full lib suite: 463 total (449 baseline + 10 new + 4 ignored baseline) — verified via filtered run (453 filtered out at baseline count). KNOWN-TRANSIENT DEVIATION from testStrategy 'zero new warnings': cargo check --lib shows 2 dead-code warnings for runtime_dir/live_config, which task 281's handler wiring consumes; recorded here and in CHANGELOG, to be closed at 281. Worktree: ranger-loop-277-291, uncommitted (no commit yet; commit at phase boundaries).",
