      "description": "Append-only per-cycle ledger in the runtime dir covering the spec's 7-row metric catalog, with QM-summary sidecar ingestion and gap flagging. No proposals exist yet — this phase only measures.",
      "details": "HARD RULES (loop spec, non-negotiable — violation fails the task): the loop never merges, never pushes to master, never restarts the service, never writes the live tree or live config, never sends outbound mail/chat.\n\nNew file src/self_improve/metrics.rs. Ledger file rt_dir/self_improve/ledger.jsonl (follow the support_watch runtime-dir pattern: set_runtime_dir + paths under the runtime dir, cf. main.rs:700). One JSON object per cycle: timestamp, routine outcomes by routine id (from the CPU routine-handler path), support-watcher stats via support_watch::status_snapshot() (src/support_watch/mod.rs:458), test results from the QM-summary sidecar (below), restart counts from Helix startup markers in runtime logs, error-log counts via cpu check_error_logs() FILTERED ErrorFindings (src/cpu/mod.rs:716 — post-task-276: counts + per-file counts + totals ONLY; NEVER persist the `recent` lines — the ledger is metadata-only, no bodies, no secrets), proposal outcomes from proposals.json (empty until Phase 1).\n\nQM-SIDECAR (spec gap found in grounding — the spec says test results are 'ingested from its run log' but names no transport, and the R630 cannot read the sandbox QM logs): define qm-summary.json with fields {date, grok_tip, helix_tip, grok_suite, helix_lib, js, ci_failed_count}, dropped into rt_dir/self_improve/ by the QM run or by John. Parser is lenient: missing file or unparseable content records \"qm_missing\": true — a ledger GAP, which blocks Phase 1 per spec acceptance. Document the sidecar format in the module docs and CHANGELOG.\n\nLedger append is atomic (write temp + rename) and never rewrites history. Expose collect_cycle() for the routine handler (task 281). Update CHANGELOG.md.\n\nRANGER 1 RESULT: RANGER 1: metrics.rs — LedgerEntry + collect_cycle (atomic temp+rename append, never rewrites history), read_ledger (corrupt lines skipped+counted), latest_entry, log_line (counts-only), count_restarts (Helix is running... marker), QmSummary lenient parser (missing/unparseable = qm_missing gap flag, blocks Phase 1). 7/7 new tests green (round-trip, missing/malformed sidecar gap, lenient partial sidecar, chatter-only fixture = 0 errors with 322685 total visible, no secret-shaped strings, log-line format). Ledger lives at rt/self_improve/ledger.jsonl per [self_improve] ledger_path. 2 dead-code warnings (runtime_dir/live_config) still pending 281 wiring.",
