      "testStrategy": "Tests: fixture proposal evaluates green end-to-end with a correct report; a deliberately failing touched-module test yields a fail report; gate-closed (eval_set_approved=false) never promotes even on green; diff > 500 lines rejected pre-eval; worktree cleanup verified (no dir remains after eval; 24h sweep removes a planted stale dir); max-1-worktree enforced (a second eval while one is alive is refused). cargo check --lib zero new warnings; lib suite green.",
      "title": "Loop Phase 2: worktree evaluator (bounded tests + eval gate, D5-GATED)"
