      "description": "Scan every proposal diff for secret-shaped strings (metadata-only, task-265 pattern) and enforce the spec's sensitive-path list with needs-human-review.",
      "details": "HARD RULES (loop spec, non-negotiable — violation fails the task): the loop never merges, never pushes to master, never restarts the service, never writes the live tree or live config, never sends outbound mail/chat.\n\nNew file src/self_improve/audit.rs: scan the DIFF (not the whole repo) for secret-shaped strings using the task-265 metadata-only pattern — log keys/paths/counts, NEVER values. The audit report records file + line count + pattern class only; the offending value is never copied into any log, report, branch, or task entry. ANY hit blocks the proposal and raises a metadata-only alert for John.\n\nSensitive-path list EXACTLY as specced (D4 confirmed as-is, no additions or removals): src/security.rs, src/tools/shell_security.rs, src/tools/shell_tool.rs, src/config/shell.rs; src/io/web_server/mod.rs auth middleware (require_web_token) and /ops/* handlers; src/support_watch/ auto-send policy and draft/send paths; token/credential handling anywhere (path or content matching token|auth_token|secret in code or config handling); src/cron/registry.rs and src/cpu/mod.rs routine dispatch. A diff touching any sensitive path → status needs-human-review, stops here: no eval pass counts for it, it never reaches Phase 3, and John must open any PR himself after reading it. Update CHANGELOG.md.\n\nRANGER 1 RESULT: RANGER 1: audit.rs — audit_diff over diff files only: secret-value scan (github-token, api-key, bearer-token, private-key, password/secret/api-key assignments; hand-rolled shapes, no regex dep) aggregated per file per class, metadata-only (file + line count + class, NEVER values); sensitive-path matcher for the exact D4 list (6 exact paths, web-auth-surface file rule, support_watch draft/send/auto_send rule, token/secret/auth path + word-boundary credential-content rule, registry/cpu dispatch paths). apply_audit_status: secrets -> blocked (not open, retry allowed), sensitive -> needs-human-review (open, blocks duplicates until John resolves). alert_line metadata-only. 4/4 tests green (fixture secrets blocked + no fixture value in report or alert, clean diff passes, all 11 sensitive classes flagged, needs-human-review stub test for the 290 gate — TODO(290) to replace with a gate-level test + re-run). Phase 2 committed in branch.",
