      "details": "HARD RULES (loop spec, non-negotiable — violation fails the task): the loop never merges, never pushes to master, never restarts the service, never writes the live tree or live config, never sends outbound mail/chat.\n\nRanger 1: evaluate 5 real proposals end-to-end. JOHN SPOT-CHECKS each eval report against a manual run (his eyeball — record his confirmation per proposal in the task results). Verify worktree cleanup (no orphan worktree dirs 24h after each eval — sweep logs). Prove zero live-tree modifications (live checkout git status clean of loop files across all 5 evals). Every promoted proposal must have the approved eval set green — IF D5 approval is still pending, this gate CANNOT pass: record that explicitly (gate stays open until John approves the task-242 set or a replacement, even if the 5 reports are otherwise correct). Update CHANGELOG.md.",
